{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP WHY AMBER  ·  lu-pdp-why-amber.liquid  (mockup section 2, Image with text + chart)
  Paste into: Long Light product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), directly after
  Product information. Sand scheme. Image: upload lu-why-amber.jpg (build/media, the hero render cropped
  4:5 at 61%). The light-test chart is footnote 3 on this page (stability test, illustrative).
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="why-amber" class="lu-sec lu-s-sand lu-pdp-amber" aria-labelledby="amber-title">
  <div class="container-fluid lu-feature">
    <div class="lu-feature__media">
      <div class="lu-media lu-r45 lu-media--solo lu-pdp-amber__img"><img class="" src="{{ 'lu-why-amber.jpg' | file_img_url: '1200x' }}" width="1200" height="1500" loading="lazy" alt="Long Light Serum on a travertine block in late sun, leaf shadows across a warm wall"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lu-feature__text">
      <p class="lu-eyebrow">Why amber</p>
      <h2 id="amber-title" class="lu-h2">The bottle does half the <em>work.</em></h2>
      <p class="lu-body-copy">Vitamin C and the carotenoids in sea buckthorn both fade in light. So we chose a stable form of vitamin C, then put it in amber glass, which filters most of the light that breaks them down. A slim dropper lets in less air than a jar or a pump, so the last drop is as good as the first.</p>
      <figure class="lu-pdp-chart" data-liquid="light-test-chart">
        <figcaption>Vitamin C left after 12 weeks in daylight<sup class="lu-fn" data-fn="3">3</sup></figcaption>
        <div class="lu-pdp-bars" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart: 97% of the vitamin C remained in amber glass after 12 weeks in daylight, against 82% in clear glass.">
          <div class="lu-pdp-bar is-ours">
            <span class="lu-pdp-bar__key"><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-amber"/></svg><span>Amber glass<small>Long Light’s bottle</small></span></span>
            <span class="lu-pdp-bar__track"><i style="--v: 97%"></i></span>
            <b class="lu-pdp-bar__val lu-tnum">97%</b>
          </div>
          <div class="lu-pdp-bar">
            <span class="lu-pdp-bar__key"><svg class="lu-ico"><use href="#lu-i-amber"/></svg><span>Clear glass<small>Same formula</small></span></span>
            <span class="lu-pdp-bar__track"><i style="--v: 82%"></i></span>
            <b class="lu-pdp-bar__val lu-tnum">82%</b>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
      <ul class="lu-pdp-facts">
        <li><svg class="lu-ico lu-ico--lg"><use href="#lu-i-dropper"/></svg><span><b>A dropper, not a pump</b>Less air in, and you measure every drop.</span></li>
        <li><svg class="lu-ico lu-ico--lg"><use href="#lu-i-pao"/></svg><span><b>Six months once open</b>One bottle lasts about ten weeks, twice a day.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="lu-footnotes"><span data-fn-note="3"><sup class="lu-fn">3</sup>Stability test: vitamin C content by HPLC after 12 weeks under daylight-equivalent light at 25&nbsp;°C, the same formula in amber and in clear glass. Illustrative placeholder data.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lu-pdp-amber .lu-feature{align-items: center;}
.lu-pdp-amber .lu-feature__text .lu-h2{margin-top: 18px;}
.lu-pdp-chart{margin-top: 28px; padding: 22px 24px 20px; border-radius: var(--lu-radius); background: var(--lu-linen);}
.lu-pdp-chart figcaption{font: 600 12px/16px var(--lu-body); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;}
.lu-pdp-bars{display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px;}
.lu-pdp-bar{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 148px 1fr 44px; align-items: center; gap: 14px;}
.lu-pdp-bar__key{display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 18px;}
.lu-pdp-bar__key .lu-ico{width: 26px; height: 26px; stroke-width: 1.4; color: var(--lu-dusk-72);}
.lu-pdp-bar.is-ours .lu-pdp-bar__key .lu-ico{color: var(--lu-clay); fill: var(--amber-fill);}
.lu-pdp-bar__key small{display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-bar__track{position: relative; height: 14px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; background: var(--lu-sand);}
.lu-pdp-bar__track i{position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: var(--v); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; background: var(--lu-dusk-72);}
.lu-pdp-bar.is-ours .lu-pdp-bar__track i{background: var(--lu-terracotta);}
.lu-pdp-bar__val{font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-align: right;}
.lu-pdp-facts{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;}
.lu-pdp-facts li{display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-facts b{display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; font: 400 17px/1.25 var(--lu-display); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));}
.lu-pdp-facts .lu-ico--lg{width: 30px; height: 30px;}
.lu-pao-t{font: 600 7px var(--lu-body); fill: currentColor; stroke: none; letter-spacing: .02em;}
.lu-pdp-amber .lu-footnotes{margin-top: 22px;}
@media (max-width: 767px){
.lu-pdp-amber .lu-feature__text{margin-top: 36px;}
.lu-pdp-chart{padding: 18px 16px 16px;}
.lu-pdp-bar{grid-template-columns: 118px 1fr 38px; gap: 10px;}
.lu-pdp-bar__key{gap: 8px; font-size: 13px;}
.lu-pdp-bar__key .lu-ico{width: 22px; height: 22px;}
.lu-pdp-facts{grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;}
}
.lu-pdp-chart .lu-ico{fill:none}
.lu-pdp-facts{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:24px 0 0}
</style>
